     SC_DFLT_FONT
            This option will specify the default font.  Available fonts are:
            iso, iso2, koi8-r, koi8-u, cp437, cp850, cp865, cp866 and cp866u.
            16-line, 14-line and 8-line font data will be compiled in.  With‐
